{"channelId":"UCxLPNStXMoXc5Ub6IlZoBiw","row":["Galgos del Sol Animal Rescue",98300,"www.galgosdelsol.org \nFollow us on Facebook https://www.facebook.com/pages/Galgos-del-Sol/175718192447988?fref=ts\n\nGalgos del Sol was founded by Tina Solera & is a registered charity (G30856736) based in Murcia, Spain. \n\nRecently we have been accepted as a registered USA 501c charity & a UK non profit!\n\nWe rescue and rehabilitate abandoned and injured Galgos for placement in forever homes in the UK, Europe, and US. Bred solely for hunting, thousands of Galgos are abandoned or killed annually at the end of each short hunting season. \n\nGalgos are not typically considered as pets in Spain and their lives end in less than humane ways either in perreras (kill stations) or abandoned to a life of persecution on the streets. \n\nGDS is passionately committed to the welfare of galgos and works tirelessly to educate the public about their plight & are currently raising funds to build an education & rescue centre. You can find out more about the Centre on our webpage www.galgosdelsol.org","",""],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCxLPNStXMoXc5Ub6IlZoBiw","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCxLPNStXMoXc5Ub6IlZoBiw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:09:23.365Z","channelId":"UCxLPNStXMoXc5Ub6IlZoBiw","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"9e4f100fb79ea8ee0dad79d57960edff9a3f306ab456d89931032c41f7f0ca2f","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"ffc621ff220d7fc79b7b2960a6771a9aeac6538cbc5fabb71598f4dd42283731"},"countrySource":{},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCxLPNStXMoXc5Ub6IlZoBiw","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":98300,"raw":"98.3K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCxLPNStXMoXc5Ub6IlZoBiw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:09:23.365Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":[],"relevantKeywords":[],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":